crease","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOQy16Z3hYT0VyMzJSQmZkMnpuV0tCQzBBc2lLaGJKNDA5V05fUDRjUU5OcEd1RDFfWGtmemlYbEkyX2VFTUZuM2QwTHhvUWR4RVNkckdiUXN2bXMteVR2ZDBZTFlPV3NhdVdUbnVXZ19qWExXRU5VaWpGNk5iV2p2bmtfLVZkbVRzQkIxck9PdXI5QQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"更新：世邦魏理仕集團第三季​​核心獲利、營收成長"},{"title":"[CBRE Group Q3 2026 Earnings Call] CBRE Powers 28% Core EPS Growth on 80% Data Center Services Surge, Holds 2027 Outlook Despite Capital Markets Freeze","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9DczIzV1RURjRlUE1oUlVTRnFFZ0RENjU5aXA5X3hzc3M5c0xVQ1FzNzVqV185SWxVdTA2SVQyTUpHTTZ2a25rVl9ocl9hMW9zNU0wTDRxbDVrZ1dQaEE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"[世邦魏理仕集團 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] 世邦魏理仕核心每股收益成長 28%，資料中心服務激增 80%，儘管資本市場凍結，但仍維持 2027 年展望"},{"title":"CBRE: Core EPS grew 28% as infrastructure demand and Development gains powered Q3 results","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"世邦魏理仕：基礎建設需求與發展收益推動第三季業績，核心每股收益成長 28%"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":11},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"資料中心","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1138118/000113811826000005/cbre-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CBRE is the world's largest commercial real estate services and investments firm (based on 2025 revenue). We derive competitive advantage from our considerable scale and ability to offer integrated solutions for real estate investors and occupiers in more than 100 countries. We are global market leaders in most of our business lines and drive significant growth by helping clients optimize real estate costs, value, investment returns and workplace experiences. These capabilities, combined with our extensive knowledge platform (research, data, strategy, etc.), allow us to generate superior outcomes for our clients, which included nearly 90% of Fortune 100 companies and many of the world's largest institutional real estate investors in 2025.","zh":"世邦魏理仕是全球最大的商业房地产服务和投资公司（基于 2025 年收入）。我们的竞争优势来自于我们为 100 多个国家的房地产投资者和租户提供综合解决方案的规模和能力。我們在大多數業務領域都是全球市場領導者，並透過幫助客戶優化房地產成本、價值、投資回報和工作場所體驗來推動顯著成長。這些能力與我們廣泛的知識平台（研究、數據、策略等）相結合，使我們能夠為客戶創造卓越的成果，其中包括 2025 年近 90% 的財富 100 強公司和許多全球最大的機構房地產投資者。"},{"en":"Our growth opportunity is enhanced by the large and expanding total addressable market for our services. We are focused on cementing our leadership position in each of our businesses with a strategy that achieves growth across four dimensions of our business: geographies, clients, property types and services. We are committed to deploying our resources and capital in parts of our business that benefit from secular tailwinds and/or are cyclically resilient across these four dimensions. Examples of how we have expanded our participation in secularly favored and resilient businesses and enlarged our total addressable market include our acquisitions of:","zh":"我们服务的庞大且不断扩大的总体目标市场增强了我们的增长机会。我們專注於鞏固我們在每項業務中的領導地位，制定策略，在業務的四個維度上實現成長：地理、客戶、物業類型和服務。我们致力于将我们的资源和资本部署到受益于长期顺风和/或在这四个维度上具有周期性弹性的部分业务。我们如何扩大对长期受青睐和有弹性的业务的参与并扩大我们的总潜在市场的例子包括我们的收购："},{"en":"J&J Worldwide Services (now doing business as CBRE Government & Defense Services), which markedly increased the facilities-related services we provide to the U.S. federal government;","zh":"J&J Worldwide Services（現以 CBRE Government & Defense Services 名義開展業務），顯著增加了我們向美國聯邦政府提供的設施相關服務；"}],"markets":[{"en":"We serve clients and report our financial results through four business segments: Advisory Services, Building Operations & Experience, Project Management and Real Estate Investments. We also report results for a Corporate and other segment, which encompasses our platform and non-core investments.","zh":"我們透過四個業務部門為客戶提供服務並報告我們的財務表現：諮詢服務、建築營運和體驗、專案管理和房地產投資。我们还报告企业和其他部门的业绩，其中包括我们的平台和非核心投资。"},{"en":"Advisory Services provides a comprehensive range of services globally, including leasing, capital markets (property sales and mortgage origination), loan servicing, and valuation. With a global network of experts that have a deep understanding of their local markets, we offer comprehensive insights and solutions across a wide range of assets, including offices, industrial and logistics, retail, multi-family and critical facilities, such as data centers, laboratories, and government facilities. Our client base is comprised of large occupiers and investors that contract for our services across multi-market portfolios as well as local market clients that we serve on a one-off basis.","zh":"諮詢服務在全球範圍內提供全面的服務，包括租賃、資本市場（房地產銷售和抵押貸款發放）、貸款服務和估值。憑藉對當地市場有深入了解的全球專家網路，我們為各種資產提供全面的見解和解決方案，包括辦公室、工業和物流、零售、多戶住宅和關鍵設施，例如資料中心、實驗室和政府設施。我們的客戶群包括在多市場投資組合中簽訂服務合約的大型租戶和投資者，以及我們一次性服務的本地市場客戶。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Building Operations Experience","val":23224000000,"zh":"建構營運經驗"},{"name":"Advisory Services","val":8840000000,"zh":"諮詢服務部門"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"專案管理部門"},{"name":"Real Estate Investments","val":879000000,"zh":"房地產投資部門"}],"total":40550000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Facilities Management","val":20645000000,"zh":"設施管理"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"專案管理"},{"name":"Advisory Leasing","val":4497000000,"zh":"諮詢租賃"},{"name":"Property Management","val":2529000000,"zh":"物業管理"},{"name":"Advisory Sales","val":2120000000,"zh":"諮詢銷售"},{"name":"Valuation","val":815000000,"zh":"估價"},{"name":"Investment Management Property Management Brokerage & Other Professional Services","val":602000000,"zh":"投資管理 物業管理 經紀及其他專業服務"},{"name":"Bank Servicing","val":357000000,"zh":"銀行服務"},{"name":"Other Portfolio Services","val":354000000,"zh":"其他組合服務"},{"name":"Real Estate Development Services","val":266000000,"zh":"房地產開發服務"}],"total":40550000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":22848000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"All Other Countries","val":11993000000,"zh":"所有其他國家"},{"name":"GB","val":5709000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":40550000000}},"peers":["JLL","ALLE","FTV","IQV","REG"]}}